---
description: Model and harness selection for every new SwarmHarm rollout
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/working-context.md` and `docs/axonhub-routing.md` before preparation.
- All live inference goes through AxonHub, including Claude Code.
- OpenAI models use Codex. Claude models use Claude Code. Never run Haiku, Sonnet or Opus through Pi.
- The headline matrix uses Sol 5.6 and 6.1 with native Codex, high reasoning and goal mode off.
- If the required adapter is missing, implement and validate it before registration. Do not silently substitute another harness.
- Any explicitly requested Sol 5.6 Pi comparison needs its own registration.
- Replay a published case with its sealed source and registration.
- Runtime/CLI versions can be updated after validation and fresh registration; preserve frozen runs.
